      "node_id": "kg_doc_2",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Caroline Wozniacki (] , ] ; born 11 July 1990) is a Danish professional tennis player. She is a former world No. 1 on the WTA Tour, having held this position for 67 weeks. She was the first woman from a Scandinavian country to hold the top ranking position and 20th overall. She finished on top of the rankings in both 2010 and 2011.",
